{"id":"0e66edf771659db2","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-sierpinski-set.md","title":"Sierpiński Set","display":"df-sierpinski-set — Sierpiński Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sierpinski-set","aliases":["58-df-sierpinski-set"],"display":"df-sierpinski-set — Sierpiński Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-null.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sierpinski-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sierpinski-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sierpinski-set — Sierpiński Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"220c3ec67ac40d73\" href=\"?note=220c3ec67ac40d73\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-null.md\">../batch12/58-df-null.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal L,\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal L,\\lambda)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c=|\\mathbb R|\">\\(\\mathfrak c=|\\mathbb R|\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Null}_\\lambda:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Null}_\\lambda:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (Lebesgue-null compatibility predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"220c3ec67ac40d73\" href=\"?note=220c3ec67ac40d73\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-null.md\">../batch12/58-df-null.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|:V\\to V\">\\(|\\cdot|:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SierpinskiSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SierpinskiSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SierpinskiSet}_\\lambda:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SierpinskiSet}_\\lambda:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SierpinskiSet}_\\lambda:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SierpinskiSet}_\\lambda:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sierpinski\\text{-}set\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{SierpinskiSet}_S(S,\\mathcal L,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal L,\\lambda)\\land S\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land|S|=\\mathfrak c\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathcal L\\;(\\lambda(N)=0\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(S\\cap N))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sierpinski\\text{-}set\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{SierpinskiSet}_S(S,\\mathcal L,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal L,\\lambda)\\land S\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land|S|=\\mathfrak c\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathcal L\\;(\\lambda(N)=0\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(S\\cap N))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sierpinski\\text{-}set\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\operatorname{SierpinskiSet}_\\lambda(S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SierpinskiSet}_S(S,\\mathcal L,\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sierpinski\\text{-}set\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\operatorname{SierpinskiSet}_\\lambda(S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SierpinskiSet}_S(S,\\mathcal L,\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sierpiński and Luzin sets are measure/category analogues; “duality” here is heuristic rather than a canonical set operation.</li>\n<li>The existence of Sierpinski sets follows from CH and is independent of ZFC in common forcing extensions.</li>\n<li>The explicit core tests <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(N)=0\">\\(\\lambda(N)=0\\)</span> in the same displayed measure space; it no longer lets the unary null-set alias choose a different measurable-space witness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-null.md","status":"resolved","id":"220c3ec67ac40d73","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-null.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak c=|\\mathbb R|$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-null.md","status":"resolved","id":"220c3ec67ac40d73","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Null}_\\lambda:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (Lebesgue-null compatibility predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-null.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|\\cdot|:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal L,\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak c=|\\mathbb R|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Null}_\\lambda:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\cdot|:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SierpinskiSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SierpinskiSet}_\\lambda:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SierpinskiSet}_\\lambda:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sierpinski\\text{-}set\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{SierpinskiSet}_S(S,\\mathcal L,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal L,\\lambda)\\land S\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land|S|=\\mathfrak c\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathcal L\\;(\\lambda(N)=0\\to\\mathrm{Countable}_S(S\\cap N))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathr